{"unit_id":"zl99103__dsh-answer-sound#feature-1","repo":"zl99103/dsh-answer-sound","commit":"d16c1b2e5e1284a26832e7efe19fbce75e54485a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-answer-sound 的功能「开始、完成与错误提示」：插件监听对话的运行状态：开始回答时播放开始音，正常结束时播放完成音，记录到 agent 错误时播放错误音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:76-92","lib/client.js:105-134"]}
